# これがないと新規ワークフロー YAML が silent に gitignore される
!workflows/
!workflows/**
!pieces/
!pieces/**
!facets/
!facets/personas/
!facets/personas/**
!facets/policies/
!facets/policies/**
!facets/knowledge/
!facets/knowledge/**
!facets/instructions/
!facets/instructions/**
!facets/output-contracts/
!facets/output-contracts/**
